msgid "Spitzli Development — Software, APIs & Cloud"
msgstr "Spitzli Development — Software, APIs & Cloud"

msgid ""
"I develop web applications, APIs and cloud infrastructure. Dominik Spitzli "
"— independent software developer and system architect."
msgstr ""
"Ich entwickle Webanwendungen, APIs und Cloud-Infrastruktur. Dominik Spitzli "
"— selbstständiger Softwareentwickler und Systemarchitekt."

msgid "Skip to content"
msgstr "Zum Inhalt"

